# The same screen, with one save, and two items change.
#
# **This is the conditional half of the menu**, and the reason there are two menu tests rather than
# one: `load existing game` becomes active and `continue` appears at all. **Sean, 2026-10-01**: *top
# menu items are continue, load, new game, exit* - four - where his 2026-10-07 design lists three.
# **So this test is what says the fourth is conditional** rather than dropped.
#
# **A save has a name**, which `P-608`'s *save games will have a name* already requires.

{test name:continue-is-offered-once-a-game-has-been-saved}

{given}
{screen name:menu}
{save name:first-game} -> 1

{then}
{screen name:menu}
{item of:menu name:continue active:1} -> 1
{item of:menu name:create-new-game active:1} -> 1
{item of:menu name:load-existing-game active:1} -> 1
{item of:menu name:quit active:1} -> 1
{attention of:continue}
